---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { site } from '../site';
---

<Page
  label="Contact"
  title="Tell me about the business"
  standfirst="What it does, what’s been bothering you, and what you’ve already tried. That’s enough to start a useful conversation."
  description="Get in touch with Jordan Mogck about a project."
>
  <section class="frame section--tight section--flush">
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="col-reading">
        <div class="prose">
          <p>
            I read everything myself and usually reply within a couple of days. If it’s
            clearly not a fit, I’ll say so and point you somewhere better if I can think of
            anywhere.
          </p>
          <p>
            Worth knowing before you write: I take on a few engagements at a time, so the
            answer sometimes has to be “not until spring.” I’d rather tell you that up
            front than run a queue.
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="contact__email">
          <a class="invitation" href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>
            {site.email} <span class="arrow">→</span>
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <aside class="col-margin contact__aside">
        <p class="label">Also useful</p>
        <ul class="contact__list meta">
          <li>A phone call beats a form for anything complicated.</li>
          <li>
            If you found me through someone we both know, say who — it saves us both a
            round of context.
          </li>
          <li>
            Not ready to talk? <a href="/writing/">The essays</a> will tell you how I think
            about most of this.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Page>

<style>
  .contact__email {
    margin-top: var(--space-l);
  }

  .contact__aside {
    align-self: start;
  }

  .contact__list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-top: var(--space-s);
    max-width: 20em;
  }

  .contact__list li + li {
    margin-top: var(--space-s);
    padding-top: var(--space-s);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
</style>
